Another important lesson, don't kick chests!
Kicking chests destroys any potions inside and also sets off traps.
Get a key/ lock pick and use that to open a weapon. If you dont have 
one, find a junk weapon (verify it is uncursed first), wield it and 
force the lock.
If it is so early in the game that you have none of the above then 
either leave the chest alone (as you would a fountain or a sink) until 
you have the right equipment to open the chest OR kick the chest and 
deal with the consequences.

As for not being able to untrap certain traps, this is because you lack 
the equipment.Magic traps, tele traps, flame traps, rust traps and pits 
cant be untrapped. How would you go about untrapping them anyway?
(In Slash'Em you can untrap some of these traps, but thats Slash'em.)

